# Assembled GitHub Pages preview (make site-build)
_site/

# Editor configuration. Kept local rather than committed: it pins an SDK path
# and a local opam switch, neither of which ports to another machine.
.vscode/

# macOS/iCloud sync-conflict copies ('foo 2.ml'). These break dune mid-build:
# it tries to compile them as a module named 'Foo 2', which is not a valid name.
# The leading space matters — a bare *[0-9].ml would also swallow garch11.ml.
* [0-9].ml
* [0-9].mli
* [0-9].js
* [0-9].html
* [0-9].css
